{
  "room": "S51",
  "notes": "Dubravka tram stop, 29 October 2020 afternoon (bg_natural/S51.webp): wind in the yellow lindens, leaves falling onto the lawn and the road and drifting onto the platform, clouds, the clock's second hand (old brass frame), the orange dots of the LED board shimmering, pigeons on the platform. Every 90 s (first 6 s after entering) an unbranded modern low-floor tram comes in from the far end, brakes into the stop, waits 10 s and pulls out towards the camera (tram2020_*: one sprite from a paid edit, cut by art/ambient/natural/vehicles/build_s51.py, chain written by layers.py; hidden with reduced motion).",
